# The pictures of drawings.md: a block with one rounded edge, its
# drawing sheet, a section and two dimensions. Coordinates are those
# of the 600x600 headless windows; a row of the property browser is
# 10 pixels high and a character 9 wide.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 382.5 232.5
down L 382.5 232.5
up L 382.5 232.5
menu Features|Fillet Edges
twmove 150 125
twdown L 150 125
twup L 150 125
edit 10
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
shot drawings-1-model
# The drawing's screen.
menu View|Drawing Sheet...
size tw 760 600
cursor on
twmove 470 75
mark 424 70 218 22 tw
shot drawings-2-screen tw
size tw 600 600
cursor off
twdown L 470 75
twup L 470 75
size gw 800 600
shot drawings-3-sheet gw
size gw 600 600
# A title, and a section through the top view.
twmove 181 386
twdown L 181 386
twup L 181 386
edit BLOCK
twmove 46 266
twdown L 46 266
twup L 46 266
edit top 8
# Back to the model to pick what to dimension: the rounded face, then
# the straight edge where it meets the top.
twmove 470 75
twdown L 470 75
twup L 470 75
view default
cursor on
move 350 260
down L 350 260
up L 350 260
twmove 46 356
twdown L 46 356
twup L 46 356
edit top radius
move 330 260
down L 330 260
up L 330 260
mark 316 188 28 154
shot drawings-4-edge
twmove 46 376
twdown L 46 376
twup L 46 376
edit front length 12
cursor off
tw
twmove 470 75
twdown L 470 75
twup L 470 75
size gw 800 600
shot drawings-5-dimensioned gw
